          Thanks<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>\r\n                  ftr</font></span>\r\n              <div><br>\r\n                <br>\r\n                <br>\r\n                On Wednesday, October 2, 2013 9:11:23 PM UTC+2, Àngela\r\n                Ribas wrote:</div>\r\n              <div>\r\n                <div>\r\n                  <blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n                    <div dir=\"ltr\">Hi ,\r\n                      <div><br>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div><a href=\"http://rforge.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rforge.net&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477228427000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3O30kirKWUVTntJej0xqEO\">rforge.net</a>\r\n                        is down. I cannot complete the installation of\r\n                        deducer on a Mac. Any workaround? </div>\r\n                      <div><br>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div>many thanks for your support!</div>\r\n                      <div><br>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div>angi<br>\r\n                        <div><br>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div>\r\n                          <div>&gt; JGR()</div>\r\n                          <div>Starting JGR ...</div>\r\n                          <div><br>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div>trying URL &#39;<a href=\"http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477228427000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02blZ1bm4u7rHfCOrd40vM\">http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg</a>&#39;</div>\r\n                          <div>Error in download.file(&quot;<a href=\"http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477228427000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02blZ1bm4u7rHfCOrd40vM\">http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg</a>&quot;,\r\n                             : </div>\r\n                          <div>  cannot open URL &#39;<a href=\"http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477228427000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02blZ1bm4u7rHfCOrd40vM\">http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg</a>&#39;</div>\r\n                          <div>In addition: Warning message:</div>\r\n                          <div>In download.file(&quot;<a href=\"http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477228427000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02blZ1bm4u7rHfCOrd40vM\">http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/JGR-1.6-SL.dmg</a>&quot;,\r\n                             :</div>\r\n                          <div>  unable to connect to &#39;<a href=\"http://www.rforge.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rforge.net&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792477228427000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3d_lt2HrErjzOuNbKMoQF7\">www.rforge.net</a>&#39; on\r\n                            port 80.</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div><br>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </blockquote>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div>\r\n